  "title": "Lamb Feta Peppers",
  "description": "Since I am Greek, I have learned many good Greek recipes over the years! This is one of my favorites. It’s a savory combination of lamb, rice and feta cheese stuffed into sweet green bell peppers and smothered with tomato sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Taseia"
  ],
